      "story_role": "new_user_problem",
      "new_script_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "C06-07",
      "statement": "Kutol稱Kay Zufall為Joseph的sister-in-law，並將她連到幼兒園把清潔膏作造型材料。",
      "source_ids": [
